        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1644_5989.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear> willig dienst und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> wir
<lb n="2"/>liebs und guots vermoegend zuovor, Edler,
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehrnvester</unclear> und Weiser, Insonders lieber
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Herr</unclear> Landtvogt, guoter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frund</unclear> und nachbar.
<lb n="5"/>Wir haben in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsrer</unclear> fangenschafft, ein ver=
<lb n="6"/>daechtige weibs person die sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nambt</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Cathrina
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Muellerin</unclear></persName> von <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Uerikhon</unclear></placeName> im gricht <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Stäfen</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="8"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-32" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Zuericher</placeName> gebiets nit weit von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-225" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rappersweil</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="9"/>gelegen. Dieweil nun wir nit allein
<lb n="10"/>von iro <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">selbs</unclear>, sonders auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserem</unclear> zuechtiger <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">theil</unclear>
<lb n="11"/>verstanden, daß sy under <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euwerß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorfaren</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>Herrn Landtvogts <persName resp="#ner">Heinrich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Kloßen</unclear> von</persName> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-69" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Lucern</placeName>
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">regiemung</unclear>, zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-11" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Altstetten</placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umb</unclear> dieb=
<lb n="14"/>stall willen und daß sy falsch gelt außgeben,
<lb n="15"/>in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fankliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verstrickhung</unclear> komen, weil aber
<lb n="16"/>sy allein ein vier oder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuenffwuechige</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kindbetterin</unclear>
<lb n="17"/>gewesen, und daß kind <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beij</unclear> iro <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gehebt</unclear> wider
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gstalt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begnädiget</unclear>, daß sy der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fangenschafft</unclear>
<lb n="19"/>erlassen worden. Damit dann
<lb n="20"/>wir desto <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fuegklicher</unclear> mit iro <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuoprocedieren</unclear>
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wuessen</unclear>, und daß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ienige</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gebuert</unclear>, fuer=
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zenemen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wuessen</unclear>, so bitten wir euch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear>
<lb n="23"/>Ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> abschrifft <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">irer</unclear> vergicht,
<lb n="24"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">domalen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beij</unclear> iro funden worden,
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeigern</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear> allein deßhalb <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgesandtem</unclear>
<lb n="26"/>botten, nachbarlich zuokomen lassen. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Daß</unclear>
<lb n="27"/>begeren wir umb euch in <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">die</unclear> und all ander
<lb n="28"/>weg mit nachbarlichem willen zuoverdienen.
<lb n="29"/>Unß sambtlich damit Goettlicher <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bewarung</unclear>
<lb n="30"/>treuwlich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevehlende</unclear>. Datt den. <origDate when="1609" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">17</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">t</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Iunii</unclear>
<lb n="31"/>a° <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etc</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">1609</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="32"/>B. und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rh</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">etc</unclear>.
<lb n="33"/>Dem Edlen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ehrnvesten</unclear> und Weisen <persName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Cristoff</unclear> Schorno</persName>
<lb n="34"/>deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rhats</unclear> zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-71" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schweitz</unclear></placeName>, der zeit Landtvogt der Herrschafft
<lb n="35"/><placeName ref="stadtasg-places-64" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Reinthal</unclear></placeName> im obern und undren Reintal unserem
<lb n="36"/>Insonders lieben Herrn guoten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freund</unclear> und nachbarn.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1644_5990.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">An</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">H</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vogt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-64" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rinthal</unclear></placeName>. <origDate when="1609-06-12" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">12</unclear>
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Junij</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">1609</unclear></origDate>. <persName role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Jost</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schorn</unclear></persName>
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">v</unclear>. <origPlace ref="stadtasg-places-71" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schweitz</unclear></origPlace>
</p>
